WEBVTT

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:13.130
So this is the last place where Tsujigiri
was heard from, Shin-Yokohama...

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:17.390
I wondered what kind of place it was,
but it's just a small town.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:20.140
How disappointing.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.350
Oh, well.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:28.060
"Vampire - Spiderleg Aranea"
It's just right for some quick meals.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:04.290
"Silver Rise Blind Your Eyes"

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:04.290
Now, are there any
pretty young girls here?

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:08.580
You look quite dangerous.
I haven't seen you before, compatriot.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:12.420
Good grief, and I was just
out on a walk, too.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:19.050
I don't care what other people eat...
but Shin-Yoko is <i>my </i>territory.

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:21.180
Leave this place!

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:24.720
Good evening, foolish compatriot.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:30.310
What if I refuse?
How do you plan on stopping me?

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:34.690
You didn't have a plan?

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:36.990
What's with this bottle?! Let me out!

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:40.240
He was so much weaker than
I expected that I panicked.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:44.660
It's no use. No matter how much you yell,
no one but me will be able to hear you.

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.750
It'd be annoying if you regenerated...

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:51.080
...so maybe I'll just throw you
into the river like this.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:55.340
This town's got ostriches and Vamp
Control and hunters! They're all strong!

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:56.710
They'll eliminate you right away!

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:58.880
Oh? That sounds fun.

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:02.720
Change of plans.
My first meal will be a hunter.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:04.600
I can't wait!

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.970
It pains me to say this,
but I'm counting on you, Ronaldo!

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.930
Save me as soon as possible!

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:12.980
Huh? What's the matter?

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:14.900
What are you doing by
yourself at this hour?

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:16.480
Ronaldo!

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:21.150
Miss, walking around alone
at night is-- Whoa, big boobs...

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:23.530
Walking around-boob
alone-boob is dangerous-boob...

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:24.820
You idiot!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:26.580
The idiocy! Useless hunter!

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:29.700
She's a vampire!
Hurry up and eliminate her!

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:33.330
You fool. I told you,
he can't hear your voice.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:37.800
This is perfect. I'll trick him
like this and drink his blood.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.170
Boob?

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:44.220
I'm sorry, I just arrived in Shin-Yoko.

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:46.680
Will you show me around...

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:49.890
...Mr. Hunter?

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:51.140
Hey, Ass.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:54.400
Shin-Yoko, famous places, nice mood...

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.980
...d-date spot.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:57.070
He's trying so hard!

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.280
Like there are any date
spots in Shin-Yoko!

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:03.070
Anyway, aren't you supposed
to be working? Useless hunter!

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:07.700
Mis-- Uh, M-Miss...
I would be happy to, um, I can...

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.580
There's a place with
a romantic night view...

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:13.620
I'll show you a night view...
and other romantic stuff...

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:14.540
You're so bad at this.

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:16.330
Th-Thanks.

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:20.880
Then, I guess I'd like a place
where I can drink alcohol...

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:22.760
I'll drink you under the table.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.180
But the night view is lovely, too.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:27.260
Stop talking about the night view!
You're so bad at ad-libbing!

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:29.640
Oh, I-I mean...

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.020
Hey, Ass.

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:34.190
I'm sorry! It's not that
I don't like night views.

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:37.150
It's just that I'm a little hungry...

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:39.150
Oh! I-I'm sorry!

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:41.530
Then you can have this ham cutlet
I got at the convenience store earlier!

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:43.190
Don't give her something
like that, you idiot!

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:46.280
I have minced meat cutlet, too!
Which one do you want?

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:48.990
Don't keep going like she's
going to eat one of them!

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:51.120
I-I'll take the ham...

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:55.620
Don't do that! If you don't reject
him sternly, he'll keep doing this!

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:57.210
Shall I put the sauce on for you--?

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:59.460
Don't look like you've got
this under control now!

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:00.300
Huh?

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:04.880
Oh, it's nothing!
This ham is delicious!

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:09.220
Now, will you show me the night view?

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:13.310
Oh, I think vodka should be
chilled and taken straight...

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:16.730
I'll surprise him with an attack
in a place with no people!

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.570
No one's talking!

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:29.370
Wh-What kind of work does a hunter do?

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:34.500
Oh. We do stuff like beat up old naked
guys with flowers on their crotch.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:38.790
Also, we fight old guys who make us talk
dirty, and all I could say was "boobs."

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:41.460
This is something you can get mad about!

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.250
Shut up! Cut that out!

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:46.630
--Huh?
--Oh, it's nothing.

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:50.390
Oh, we're here.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:53.770
I can't wait.

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.890
R-Ronaldo!

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:06.990
Vampire Tranquilizer Bullets!

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:08.450
You--!

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:11.950
Sorry about the bad date
with the bad acting.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:15.000
I had no choice.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.500
Because I had to bring you out here...

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.670
...without letting you
get close to anyone.

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:27.800
This is dumb.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:31.300
Like <i>I'd </i>be the one to be tricked.

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:34.890
But it's fine.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:37.480
I'll make you all...

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:41.310
...my dinner, right here, right now!

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:46.280
I'll... suck your blood, you worms!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:56.290
These worms!

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:59.960
Like I'd ever...

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:06.340
...lose to them!

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:14.550
We could've beaten her
without that show you put on.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:16.260
You can only say that in hindsight.

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:19.480
It would've been bad if we fought
in a place with civilians.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:25.320
No. It was so faithful to your usual self
that I couldn't tell you were acting.

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:26.610
Gross!

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:28.030
Sand...

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:31.400
Anyway, how did you know
what she really was?

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:35.830
I knew from the start.
There was an alert issued in another town.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:40.210
Besides, she called me "Mr. Hunter"
before I'd even told her my name.

00:07:40.210 --> 00:07:41.670
Just from that?

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:45.130
Even though you're super dense and have
been leveling up your stupidity recently?

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:46.340
Sand...!

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:50.470
More than anything, I had a strong
feeling something was off...

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:56.850
...because a girl was flirting with me...

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:59.770
Ronaldo!

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:03.350
"Dress Up for You"

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:05.480
"Dress Up for You"
...ul, hey... Ronaldo.

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:10.780
Happy Halloween.

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:13.410
You're gonna give me nightmares!
What are you trying to do, moron?!

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:17.740
I'm cosplaying Sword, the main character of
the legendary shitty game, <i>Quest of Soul Gate</i>.

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:19.120
Never heard of him.

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:22.910
I'm going to do an impression of Sword
when he dies and hits his head.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:28.750
J-Just what kind of character is Sword?
He seems as weak as you!

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:32.170
No, wait. I'm asking you
<i>why </i>you're cosplaying him!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:35.430
You don't know? It's Halloween!

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:38.680
It's a day for humans and vampires to
dress up and deepen their friendships!

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:41.220
Ronaldo, will you join me?

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:43.310
Don't know. Don't care. I'm going
to sleep. Don't wake me up. Die!

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:47.310
Don't say that! John worked
hard on his costume, too!

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:50.900
Oh, John, what are you? A bug's hive?

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:52.490
He said he's a pile of melon bread.

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:54.740
I'm sorry, John! You look delicious!

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:58.490
Now, let us have a Halloween
costume party tonight!

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:01.660
No way! It's pointless!

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:10.880
There's a ton of people here!

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.340
Hey, Ronaldo.

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:14.380
It's all free. Business must be good.

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:16.720
H-Hey... Free?

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:20.720
Halloween party! Dress up and
get free grub at Ronaldo Agency!

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:23.810
I handed out invitations that said that.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:27.310
Ronaldo. Thank you for the invitation.

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:28.610
Who are you?!

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:29.980
I'm the manager at Vamima!

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:32.690
This is a cosplay of the Special
Security Robot, Gatekin!

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:34.440
Never heard of it!

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:39.200
Looks like it will be a wonderful evening.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.790
Long time no see, Ronaldo.

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.620
Thanks for inviting us.

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:44.870
Oh, um... you're welcome...

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:47.790
Nude, nude, nude...

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:50.500
Yes, this is a fun party!

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:52.000
R-Right...

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.800
Look.

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:57.130
Everyone gathered here
because they adore you.

00:09:57.130 --> 00:10:00.550
I also prepared time for you to be
the star and perform something.

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:03.680
I'm looking forward to it, Ronaldo!

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:04.930
Give me a good shot!

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:08.230
Like hell they adore me!
That's a lie! Damn you all to hell!

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:12.320
Ronaldo, what made you decide to express
Japan's seasons through pole dancing?

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:13.400
Like hell I'm doing that!

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:14.570
Hey, Ronaldo!

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:15.440
Huh?!

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:16.570
Trick-or...

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:18.030
...treat!

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:20.030
Man, these grade schoolers
don't have a shred of respect!

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:21.830
I'll give you gum! I'll give you gum!

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.290
Oh, are we doing that? Trick-or-treat!

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:26.200
We're not, idiot!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:29.210
Aww. Oh, please give me that meat.

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.970
What's the matter, John?

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:51.730
It's kind of an amazing sight, huh?
I can't tell who's who.

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:54.190
Oh, the star looks gloomy.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:57.070
I know who <i>you </i>are, scooter kid!

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:59.360
Hey, don't ride that inside!

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:01.660
Who are <i>you </i>people?!

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:04.080
We are members of John's fan club.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.870
John's cuteness...

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:09.660
...should be poured out equally to all.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:13.080
That voice!

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:15.630
Go, Celeryman Sagyo!

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:19.920
It's not what you think, Ronaldo!
I was forced to wear this--

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:21.680
Celery spirit!

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:27.350
Celery... A living, breathing celery...

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:30.140
A-Are you all right, Ronaldo?

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:33.810
Satetsu... Even your costume's boring...

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:35.520
Huh?

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:37.570
Handa and Sagyo,
what's wrong with you two?

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:39.110
We are...

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:41.570
...just here as security!

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:44.070
We're not... here to play!

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:47.540
It's fine. You're not convincing at all.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:49.660
Ronaldo, look! Look!

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:50.540
Huh?

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:52.540
My costume is a beautiful,
widowed inn proprietress

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:56.540
whose husband passed away six months ago,
who's worried about her aging body.

00:11:56.540 --> 00:12:01.170
Your idea's gross! Besides, yours is
a transformation, not a costume!

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:04.340
A transformation's fine, too!
It's a vampire's privilege!

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:06.180
Sexy dynamite!

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:08.930
Why are you getting so excited?!

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:12.640
Oh, how sexy! I can't lose!

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:13.690
It's not a competition!

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:15.730
Sexy!

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:18.570
What are you doing, Manager?!

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:20.820
Sexy!

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:21.950
Bikini!

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:23.110
Wee-wee?!

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:24.700
What...?

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:29.370
Did you just notice?

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:31.500
Foolish hunter.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.870
What, it's you, perverted vampire?!

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:39.170
A costume party? What good taste. I had no
trouble at all getting lost in the crowd.

00:12:39.170 --> 00:12:41.170
Bastard, how dare you--

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:43.220
Whoops, don't move.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:46.510
--Bikini.
--Bikini.

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:51.270
If you value the blood and lives
of these humans, then don't resist.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:53.350
Damn it, you bastard!

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:58.060
Do you understand the situation?
Then, accept my domination.

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:01.610
Vamp Control and hunters
should all wear micro bikinis!

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:04.740
From here on out,
my dominion over humans will--

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:07.660
Do you have a bingo card?

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:11.790
We're playing bingo!

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:16.460
Anyone else not have a card?
Here's a card for you.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:18.500
Huh? What was I doing?

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:22.380
Wh-Why were you able to overcome
my micro bikinis so easily...?!

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:25.630
Now, we've got some
great prizes for bingo!

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.760
Everyone, are you ready?

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:30.140
Huh? Dra... you...

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:34.810
John, Ronaldo! That's not me!

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:45.740
I've been found out? Too bad.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:48.570
So that's why you were nowhere to be found
after calling for me out of the blue!

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:51.450
Why did you transform
yourself into Draluc?!

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:55.330
Sorry, I wanted to dress up
because it was Halloween.

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:58.330
On top of that, having a party
in such a cramped office!

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:01.340
Yeah, it's absurd to have a party
in a rabbit hutch like this.

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:02.500
It <i>is </i>a little cramped.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:03.800
I'll kill you!

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:07.680
Sorry for causing you trouble
in such a cramped space, Ronaldo.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:10.260
--It's <i>not </i>cramped--
--But--

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:12.220
It was fun.

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:14.100
Goodbye, then.

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:25.690
Jeez, that man comes
and goes like a storm.

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:28.200
Keep a closer eye on him
at your family's place!

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.030
Now--

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:31.990
Sorry for the interruption, everyone!

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:35.330
Let's continue the festivities
with Ronaldo's pole dancing!

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:36.540
Huh?!

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:38.080
Yeah, I was waiting for this!

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:39.960
I'm not dancing! This party's over!

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:40.830
Aww...

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:42.790
Don't "Aww" me! I'm not dancing!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:45.760
'Scuse me! Can we at least
get the bingo prizes?

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.880
Shut up, loser! I told you,
the party's over!

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:50.390
I reserved a venue for the afterparty.

00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:51.470
Huh?!

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.300
Someplace spacious.

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:55.520
Let's go!

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:04.650
It's Dra-Dra All Night Shin-Yoko!
The afterparty venue is hopping!

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:06.360
It's pandemonium!

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:08.530
Here's today's special guest!

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:12.490
The old man called the strongest
storm in the family, Grandfather!

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:14.830
Happy Halloween.

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:17.580
I'm glad everyone looks
like they're having fun.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:19.960
Now, here we are live at the performance
everyone's been waiting for,

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:23.340
Ronaldo's Pole Dancing on Stage--
Japanese Seasons Edition...

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:26.840
That's Ronalina Typhoon to you!

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.420
Sand...!

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:35.600
Let's go to the after-afterparty next.

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:37.680
The desperate
after-after-after-afterparty!

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:42.770
"Five Dumb Matches"

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:45.820
The QS4 I've been using
since I lived at the castle...

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:50.070
I was just about to subscribe to
Netflips to watch some movies...

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:52.490
You've been using it too much,
Shitty Gamer Sand!

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:55.490
Who's the idiot who was using it roughly?!

00:15:55.490 --> 00:15:56.410
I guess we have no choice.

00:15:56.410 --> 00:16:01.460
We'll have to replace it with a QS5 Pro
Ultra Powerful Grade Justice X2.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.250
